    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: SBQQ__ConfigurationAttribute__c records where SBQQ__Required__c = true AND SBQQ__Hidden__c = true.
Why it matters: A required field that&apos;s also hidden creates an impossible-to-configure product — reps can&apos;t see the field, so they can&apos;t fill it, so they can&apos;t proceed past validation. Configuration blocks entirely.
Suppress a finding: never; this is always a misconfiguration.
Disable the detector: leave on for any org using configuration attributes.</value></values>
